-ratio","tabId":"knowledge","expectedSha256":"05a59a11a28a5bd8a4700ffa2e87a29c6271a6cfccc886749d10a2f31f6c75ca"},{"subjectId":"data-analysis","pointId":"current-ratio","tabId":"example","expectedSha256":"4c418718db8d364e15247e859c103cbd5f539b4fbb979ab33b7dd80319dd0fa0"}],"knowledgeRelationEvidence":{"kind":"original-task-and-formula","pointIds":["current-ratio"],"reason":"第三产业增加值为部分、GDP为整体，按同期同单位求部分/整体。"},"sourceProvenance":{"kind":"curated-note-example","authorIdentity":"unknown","examProvenance":"unverified-unless-separately-established"},"reviewVerified":false}],"assessmentFingerprint":"f16251e4","semanticRuntimeSignature":"f616fed3c23c77c1988d687b5b11c3f093bb4f72336ea5cb68b4317d828f48e6"},{"id":"notes-q-c01-data-analysis-application-02","revision":1,"status":"review","subjectId":"data-analysis","categoryId":"ratio","exerciseKinds":["application"],"primaryTargetIds":["notes-target-c01-data-analysis-ratio-trend"],"supportingTargetIds":[],"refs":[{"subjectId":"data-analysis","pointId":"ratio-trend","tabId":"knowledge","expectedSha256":"a81e158fea28f2d29c8d7f342ce3b4c92383a4e27c992a66b0d571fc572b6073","fingerprint":"204e59db"},{"subjectId":"data-analysis","pointId":"ratio-trend","tabId":"example","expectedSha256":"a658a710433d7b63fada4a3c203dd621f2400eba0990a427a6a8d35fabdd1f06","fingerprint":"91dea779"}],"sourceKind":"legacy-unverified","familyId":"notes-origin-notes-source-example-000034","exposureGroupId":"notes-exposure-notes-source-example-000034","answerMode":"single-choice","distractorReasons":{"A":"16%低于全国26%，与比重上升矛盾。","B":"21%低于全国26%，与比重上升矛盾。","C":"增速相等时比重不变。"},"origin":{"subjectId":"data-analysis","pointId":"ratio-trend","tabId":"example","sourceExampleRecordId":"notes-source-example-000034","expectedBlockSha256":"d49dd2b1aef715e62276972bab40922961dcc40b874fdaeb34810d34a5d0d881"},"assessment":{"taskType":"complete-application","knowledgeAtomIds":[],"requiresCalculation":true},"originTask":{"verified":true,"statement":"2019 年 1-10 月，全国快递服务企业业务量累计完成 496.6 亿件，同比增长 26%；业务收入累计完成 5929 亿元，同比增长 24%。2019 年 1-10 月，东、中、西部地区快递业务量比重分别为 79.8%、12.7% 和 7.5%，业务收入比重分别为 80.3%、11.2% 和 8.5%。与去年同期相比，东部地区快递业务量比重下降 0.1 个百分点，快递业务收入比重上升 0.3 个百分点；中部地区快递业务比重上升 0.5 个百分点，快递业务收入比重基本持平；西部地区快递业务量比重下降 0.4 个百分点，快递业务收入比重下降 0.3 个百分点。问 2019 年 1-10 月，中部地区快递业务量同比增速可能为多少。","evidence":"原例题stem包含明确求解任务；选项、答案、解析齐全，保留原块，考试题源标签未验证"},"reviewVerified":false,"resourceType":"question","prompt":"2019 年 1-10 月，全国快递服务企业业务量累计完成 496.6 亿件，同比增长 26%；业务收入累计完成 5929 亿元，同比增长 24%。2019 年 1-10 月，东、中、西部地区快递业务量比重分别为 79.8%、12.7% 和 7.5%，业务收入比重分别为 80.3%、11.2% 和 8.5%。与去年同期相比，东部地区快递业务量比重下降 0.1 个百分点，快递业务收入比重上升 0.3 个百分点；中部地区快递业务比重上升 0.5 个百分点，快递业务收入比重基本持平；西部地区快递业务量比重下降 0.4 个百分点，快递业务收入比重下降 0.3 个百分点。问 2019 年 1-10 月，中部地区快递业务量同比增速可能为多少。","options":[{"key":"A","text":"16%"},{"key":"B","text":"21%"},{"key":"C","text":"26%"},{"key":"D","text":"31%"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"方法一：中部地区业务量比重上升，说明中部业务量增速大于全国业务量增速 26%，直接选大于 26% 的选项，只有 D。方法二：也可用乘积增长率。中部业务量 = 全国业务量 × 中部占比，全国 R = 26%；中部占比由 12.2% 上升到 12.7%，占比增速约为 0.5 / (12.7 - 0.5) ≈ 4%。中部业务量增速 ≈ 26% + 4% + 26%×4% ≈ 31%，选 D。","originalExampleFingerprint":"42c38638","declaredOriginalSource":"2020 事业编联考","answerSourceKeys":["[\"data-analysis\",\"ratio-trend\",\"example\"]"],"semanticAdmission":{"questionBinding":{"questionId":"notes-q-c01-data-analysis-application-02","questionRevision":1,"effectiveContentDigest":"0e1290cc8bfc16b8aa110c56ce4630b47ed3383af30e74c8cac9c940822477a9"},"resolvedDependencyManifest":{"primaryTargets":[{"id":"notes-target-c01-data-analysis-ratio-trend","revision":2,"sha256":"f2201d0f0b85365082a872e33124be995a1d065646073fe8bffeb8595e30cbc8"}],"supportingTargets":[],"knowledgeAtoms":[],"comparisonGroups":[],"sourceBindings":[{"subjectId":"data-analysis","pointId":"ratio-trend","tabId":"example","revision":null,"sha256":"a658a710433d7b63fada4a3c203dd621f2400eba0990a427a6a8d35fabdd1f06"},{"subjectId":"data-analysis","pointId":"ratio-trend","tabId":"knowledge","revision":null,"sha256":"a81e158fea28f2d29c8d7f342ce3b4c92383a4e27c992a66b0